      "name": "web-apps",
      "title": "Web apps — an app is content, the harness publishes it",
      "description": "Interactive web apps as knowledge-graph content: a layer holds an app's source in a directory of kind `web-app` (one `web-app.json`), its UI strings go through the harness's translation process like any template, and the harness's `apps` visualiser (Tool `web-app-build`) builds it at publish and writes it to its own route with no site chrome, loaded only when a reader opens it. Read before adding an app to any layer, before writing a publish script for one (do not), and when an app's build or translations fail.",
